menu "sys_device"

    config SYS_DEVICE_MAX
        int "Registered devices"
        default 32
        range 1 1024
        help
          How many devices can be registered at once (any IDs 0..0xFFFE).
          One entry is an ID, a type, its struct pointer and its error policy.

    config SYS_DEVICE_TYPES
        int "Device types"
        default 16
        range 1 255
        help
          Device types that can be registered.

    config SYS_DEVICE_MAX_DEPS
        int "Devices one device may use"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          Distinct devices one device declares with sys_device_use() (the
          devices its pins are on, ...). Pins on the same device count once.

    config SYS_DEVICE_GUARDS
        int "Contract guards"
        default 2
        range 1 8
        help
          Contracts that can have a guard (sys_device_set_guard): a module
          that sees every call of the contract's ops before the device does
          (the power manager guards POWER_VREG).

endmenu
